  "id": "direct-correlation",
  "term": "direct correlation",
  "definition": "Direct correlation means a straightforward association between two factors, where one is linked with the other rather than the link depending on some additional condition. In the packet, it refers to perceived natural environment being associated with individual well-being in this direct way.",
